{"id":"wb-6-924","name":"侵华日军第七三一部队旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"侵華日軍第七三一部隊罪証陳列館","text":"侵华日军第七三一部队罪证陈列馆简称七三一陈列馆或七三一部队旧址，位于中华人民共和国黑龙江省哈尔滨市平房区新疆大街47号，是遗址型博物馆，于侵华日军第七三一部队旧址上建成，建筑面积9997平方米。此旧址建于1933年，大日本帝国陆军第七三一部队于1936年开始在此建立细菌武器研究生产基地，将6.1平方公里的土地作为特别军事区域。1945年8月，七三一部队在投降前炸毁了大部分建筑，形成现在的整体格局。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BE%B5%E8%8F%AF%E6%97%A5%E8%BB%8D%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%80%E9%83%A8%E9%9A%8A%E7%BD%AA%E8%A8%BC%E9%99%B3%E5%88%97%E9%A4%A8","revisionId":95006913,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95006913","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8f84540b76a3435228b31547.jpg","title":"Building_on_the_site_of_the_Harbin_bioweapon_facility_of_Unit_731_関東軍防疫給水部本部731部隊（石井部隊）日軍第731部隊旧址_PB120758.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Building_on_the_site_of_the_Harbin_bioweapon_facility_of_Unit_731_%E9%96%A2%E6%9D%B1%E8%BB%8D%E9%98%B2%E7%96%AB%E7%B5%A6%E6%B0%B4%E9%83%A8%E6%9C%AC%E9%83%A8731%E9%83%A8%E9%9A%8A%EF%BC%88%E7%9F%B3%E4%BA%95%E9%83%A8%E9%9A%8A%EF%BC%89%E6%97%A5%E8%BB%8D%E7%AC%AC731%E9%83%A8%E9%9A%8A%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_PB120758.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/Building_on_the_site_of_the_Harbin_bioweapon_facility_of_Unit_731_%E9%96%A2%E6%9D%B1%E8%BB%8D%E9%98%B2%E7%96%AB%E7%B5%A6%E6%B0%B4%E9%83%A8%E6%9C%AC%E9%83%A8731%E9%83%A8%E9%9A%8A%EF%BC%88%E7%9F%B3%E4%BA%95%E9%83%A8%E9%9A%8A%EF%BC%89%E6%97%A5%E8%BB%8D%E7%AC%AC731%E9%83%A8%E9%9A%8A%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_PB120758.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"松岡明芳","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​关东军防疫给水部本部731部队（石井部队）日军第731部队旧址","width":320,"height":240}}